WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,050
Then I have mutated

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:04,210
Just didn't turn into a zombie

3
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:06,210
Yeah, that's what I mean

4
00:00:06,210 --> 00:00:08,460
And I believe you are not the only one like this

5
00:00:08,460 --> 00:00:10,460
I'm afraid there are already many like you out there

6
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,460
An awakened person with special abilities

7
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:14,460
So practice faster

8
00:00:14,460 --> 00:00:17,330
good boss

9
00:00:17,330 --> 00:00:23,330
I've had it for a week too

10
00:00:23,330 --> 00:00:25,330
This is the first time the sun rises

11
00:00:25,330 --> 00:00:27,330
However, the temperature did not rise much

12
00:00:27,330 --> 00:00:29,330
It's now -30 degrees below zero outside

13
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:31,330
It seems it will take some time before the zombies break out

14
00:00:31,330 --> 00:00:46,130
It's okay, no rush

15
00:00:46,130 --> 00:00:48,220
Xiaochu, are you still sleeping?

16
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:50,220
Why do you sound so tired?

17
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:52,220
I'm so sleepy. There was a riot last night.

18
00:00:52,220 --> 00:00:54,220
As a building king, I spent a long time suppressing

19
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:56,220
What about you? Have you been bullied by him?

20
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:58,220
I'm fine. Don't worry.
